## AI-Powered Clinical Information Intelligence

### PRODUCT VISION

MedLens is an AI-powered clinical information organization platform that transforms scattered patient information, medical reports, laboratory results, prescriptions, and medical history into a structured, understandable, and reviewable patient record.

This is NOT a generic medical chatbot.

The main purpose of MedLens is to help users organize and understand medical information by extracting, structuring, summarizing, and visually presenting information from uploaded medical documents.

The application should feel like a modern healthcare technology product used by doctors, clinics, hospitals, and patients.

