# 9. MEDICAL REPORT PROCESSING

Implement an AI-powered pipeline.

The system should extract:

* Patient name
* Report date
* Test name
* Test value
* Unit
* Reference range
* Observation
* Abnormal values
* Laboratory name
* Doctor name if available
* Report type

For laboratory reports, structure data like:

TEST | RESULT | UNIT | REFERENCE RANGE | STATUS

Example:

Hemoglobin | 13.8 | g/dL | 13–17 | Normal

WBC | 12,400 | cells/µL | 4,000–11,000 | High

Platelets | 250,000 | /µL | 150,000–450,000 | Normal

