# 18. AI IMPLEMENTATION

Integrate an AI API if available through environment variables.

Use the AI for:

1. Medical report text analysis
2. Information extraction
3. Laboratory result structuring
4. Summary generation
5. Comparison of historical results
6. Identification of values outside the provided reference range

The AI should return structured JSON whenever possible.

Example:

{
"reportType": "Blood Test",
"reportDate": "2026-08-12",
"tests": [
{
"name": "Hemoglobin",
"value": 13.8,
"unit": "g/dL",
"referenceRange": "13-17",
"status": "Normal",
"observation": ""
}
]
}

If the AI API is not configured, implement a DEMO MODE using realistic mock data so that the entire application remains functional.

Clearly label demo-generated data as demo data.

